<title>USA: Hughes Supply buys Panhandle Pipe.</title>
<headline>Hughes Supply buys Panhandle Pipe.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said on Friday that it bought Panhandle Pipe and Supply in a stock-for-stock transaction that would be accounted for as a pooling of interest. The terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Panhandle, a distributor of water and sewer supplies and equipment, reported sales for its fiscal year ended October 31, 1996 of $8 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
